{"seq":2,"slug":"async-notify-variety","title":"各异步通知与对账协议适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/unified-adapter/async-notify-variety","wordCount":2450,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"各异步通知与对账协议适配\">各异步通知与对账协议适配</h1><p>本地支付接入里最难统一的一层是「怎么知道钱到了」。渠道方的答案五花八门：有的推送带签名的 JSON 回调、有的只发一条纯文本、有的发 XML、有的什么都不发只给一份每日对账文件、有的连对账文件都要人工从网银下载。本文给出的做法是把这些协议差异<strong>全部收敛到同一个终态收敛流程</strong>：无论信息从哪来，最终都变成对「某笔支付状态」的一次幂等断言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个正交的问题\">核心概念：三个正交的问题</h2><p>「通知差异」不是一件事，而是三个可以独立变化的问题。分开看，适配量立刻从「N 种协议」降为「N 个验签函数 + 一份解析映射」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[渠道信息到达] --&gt; B{来源类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|webhook 推送| C[解析 + 验签]&#10;    B --&gt;|主动查询| D[调用查询接口]&#10;    B --&gt;|对账文件| E[下载 + 解析 + 逐行匹配]&#10;    B --&gt;|人工导入| F[管理后台录入]&#10;    C --&gt; G[归一化为 PaymentAssertion]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{幂等断言: 状态是否推进?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[写状态机 + 发领域事件]&#10;    H --&gt;|否, 重复| J[丢弃并计数]&#10;    H --&gt;|否, 冲突| K[登记差异 → 人工队列]&#10;    I --&gt; L[订单后续: 发货/关单/退款]\">graph TD\n    A[渠道信息到达] --&gt; B{来源类型}\n    B --&gt;|webhook 推送| C[解析 + 验签]\n    B --&gt;|主动查询| D[调用查询接口]\n    B --&gt;|对账文件| E[下载 + 解析 + 逐行匹配]\n    B --&gt;|人工导入| F[管理后台录入]\n    C --&gt; G[归一化为 PaymentAssertion]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{幂等断言: 状态是否推进?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[写状态机 + 发领域事件]\n    H --&gt;|否, 重复| J[丢弃并计数]\n    H --&gt;|否, 冲突| K[登记差异 → 人工队列]\n    I --&gt; L[订单后续: 发货/关单/退款]</pre><p>三个正交问题是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>变化点</th>\n<th>适配方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>信息来源</strong></td>\n<td>webhook / 查询 / 对账文件 / 人工</td>\n<td>四个入口，各自实现采集，统一投递断言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>认证与完整性</strong></td>\n<td>HMAC 签名、非对称签名、摘要、双向 TLS、无认证</td>\n<td>每个渠道一个 <code>verify()</code> 实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>报文语义</strong></td>\n<td>字段名、状态枚举、金额单位、时间格式、时区</td>\n<td>每个渠道一份声明式映射表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>第三个问题是纯声明式的</strong>。绝大多数渠道的差异可以写成「把渠道字段 A 映射到我的字段 X，并把状态值 <code>S</code> 映射为 <code>paid</code>」这样的配置，而不是代码。把它写成代码是常见的浪费，也是 bug 来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验签-五种方式与两个陷阱\">验签：五种方式与两个陷阱</h2><p>按安全性从高到低，实际见到的验签方式有五种。</p>\n<p><strong>非对称签名（RSA/ECDSA）</strong> 最安全，渠道用私钥签名、你用公钥验签，且公私钥分离意味着你无法伪造通知。<strong>HMAC 共享密钥</strong> 次之，安全强度取决于密钥管理，问题在于密钥同时用于签名与验证，一旦泄露双方都要轮换（HMAC 的定义即 <code>H(K XOR opad, H(K XOR ipad, text))</code>，用一个双方共享的密钥 K 同时生成与校验，来源：RFC 2104, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.txt\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.txt</a>）。<strong>摘要比对</strong>（渠道在回调里带上你自己给的随机串的哈希）只防篡改不防伪造，安全性最弱但仍优于无认证。<strong>双向 TLS</strong> 常在银行直连场景使用，它是传输层认证，<strong>不替代报文签名</strong>——一旦请求被中间人终止，报文本身仍无完整性保护。<strong>无任何认证</strong> 在国内部分渠道与小额场景中真实存在，此时必须靠「回调里带的渠道单号必须能在你的库里查到」来兜底。</p>\n<p>两个陷阱必须记住。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱一：验签要用原始报文而不是解析后的对象。</strong> 大多数签名是对<strong>原始字节</strong>计算的，而 JSON 解析再序列化会改变键序、空格与数字格式，导致验签必然失败。这不是猜测——JSON 规范本身允许键序不同、<code>4.50</code> 与 <code>4.5</code>、<code>1E30</code> 与 <code>1e+30</code> 等等价但字节不同的写法，正是因为这一点，IETF 才专门制定了 JSON 规范化方案（JCS，RFC 8785）：它把对象键按 UTF-16 码元递归排序、按 ECMAScript 数字序列化规则输出、统一字符串转义、去掉空白，从而给出「可哈希、可签名的 JSON 表示」（来源：RFC 8785, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8785.txt\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8785.txt</a>）。正确做法是在 HTTP 层拿到原始 body，先验签、再解析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function handleCallback(channelId: string, raw: Buffer, headers: Headers) {&#10;  const ch = channels[channelId];&#10;  if (!(await ch.verify(raw, headers))) {&#10;    metrics.incr(&#39;callback_verify_failed&#39;, { channel: channelId });&#10;    throw new HttpError(401);&#10;  }&#10;  const parsed = ch.parse(raw);&#10;  const assertion = ch.toAssertion(parsed);&#10;  return converge(assertion);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channels[channelId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw, headers))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">incr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'callback_verify_failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { channel: channelId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">401</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> assertion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toAssertion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parsed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> converge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(assertion);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>陷阱二：验签通过不等于业务正确。</strong> 一个签名完全正确的通知仍可能是重放的旧通知、可能是针对另一笔订单的通知、也可能金额与订单不符。因此验签之后还必须有<strong>四项核对</strong>：商户单号存在、金额与订单应付一致、币种一致、渠道单号与已记录的一致（或首次记录）。这四项核对是<a href=\"../chargeback-local/fraud-by-method\">按支付方式的欺诈特征</a>里「伪造通知」这类攻击的最后一道防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知的投递保障与乱序\">通知的投递保障与乱序</h2><p>所有渠道的通知机制都只能承诺<strong>至少一次</strong>，不承诺顺序，也不承诺只发一次。因此收敛逻辑必须是幂等的，且必须能处理乱序。（「可重复执行而不产生额外副作用」这一性质在通用语义里称为幂等：HTTP 规范对幂等方法的定义即为「同一方法多次相同请求在服务端产生的预期效果，等同于单次请求的效果」，且明确指出正因为如此，当通信失败、客户端尚未读到响应时，请求可以被自动重发——这正是支付通知重投与超时重试可安全进行的前提，来源：RFC 9110 §9.2.3, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html</a>。）</p>\n<p>幂等的实现方式是把每次断言都当作对状态机的一次「带前置条件的转移」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 断言表：每条渠道通知落一行，唯一键保证不会重复处理&#10;CREATE TABLE payment_assertion (&#10;  id            BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  channel_id    VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_txn   VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  merchant_ref  VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  status        VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,     -- paid | failed | pending | refunded | expired&#10;  amount_minor  BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  currency      CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  source        VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,     -- webhook | poll | recon_file | manual&#10;  source_seq    BIGINT,                    -- 对账文件的序号/行号&#10;  occurred_at   DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,     -- 渠道声明的业务时间&#10;  received_at   DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,     -- 我们收到的时间&#10;  raw_hash      CHAR(64)     NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_source (channel_id, channel_txn, status, source_seq),&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_raw (channel_id, raw_hash),&#10;  KEY idx_merchant (merchant_ref)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 断言表：每条渠道通知落一行，唯一键保证不会重复处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> payment_assertion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_txn   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  merchant_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- paid | failed | pending | refunded | expired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- webhook | poll | recon_file | manual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_seq    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对账文件的序号/行号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 渠道声明的业务时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 我们收到的时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raw_hash      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_source (channel_id, channel_txn, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, source_seq),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_raw (channel_id, raw_hash),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_merchant (merchant_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uk_raw</code> 用原文哈希挡重复投递；<code>uk_source</code> 用来源序号挡对账文件重复导入。<code>occurred_at</code> 与 <code>received_at</code> 分离是<strong>排序的唯一依据</strong>：状态推进不能按到达顺序，必须按渠道声明的业务时间。一个典型的乱序场景是「先收到失败通知、后收到成功通知」——如果按到达顺序处理，最终状态会错误地停在失败。</p>\n<p>状态推进规则必须显式定义优先级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n<th>收到断言</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pending</td>\n<td>paid（occurred_at 更晚）</td>\n<td>推进为 paid，发领域事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pending</td>\n<td>failed</td>\n<td>推进为 failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>paid</td>\n<td>failed（occurred_at 更早）</td>\n<td><strong>忽略</strong>（乱序的旧消息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>paid</td>\n<td>paid</td>\n<td>重复，丢弃并计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>paid</td>\n<td>refunded</td>\n<td>推进为部分/全额退款态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>failed</td>\n<td>paid（更晚）</td>\n<td>推进为 paid，并登记冲突告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是最重要的：<strong>终态不是绝对的</strong>。一个渠道先返回失败、十分钟后又说成功，这不是异常，是真实发生过的。合理做法是允许恢复并同时告警，因为「已知的失败被推翻」通常意味着渠道侧有问题，需要运维介入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账文件-既无通知也无查询时的唯一手段\">对账文件：既无通知也无查询时的唯一手段</h2><p>当渠道既不推送通知、查询接口也不可靠（或只能按单查询、无法批量），对账文件就是唯一的信息源。它带来四个特有的工程要求。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，必须能拿到文件，且要有兜底。</strong> 理想形态是 API 下载；现实是很多本地渠道只提供网银后台的 CSV 下载，需要人工操作。此时要建<strong>人工导入通道</strong>并把它当作正式的架构组成（<code>source=&#39;manual&#39;</code>），而不是「临时补丁」——否则这些渠道的状态收敛就没有监控、没有重试、没有责任人。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，文件格式差异巨大但内容同构。</strong> 分隔符、编码（UTF-8/GBK/Latin-1/Shift-JIS）、日期格式、金额单位（分/元/整数倍）、金额符号、状态取值全都不同。这些<strong>全部应写进声明式映射配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;local_acquirer_id&quot;,&#10;  &quot;file&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;delimiter&quot;: &quot;|&quot;,&#10;    &quot;encoding&quot;: &quot;utf-8&quot;,&#10;    &quot;header_rows&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;date_format&quot;: &quot;yyyyMMddHHmmss&quot;,&#10;    &quot;timezone&quot;: &quot;Asia/Jakarta&quot;,&#10;    &quot;amount_scale&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;amount_fields&quot;: { &quot;gross&quot;: &quot;AMT&quot;, &quot;fee&quot;: &quot;FEE&quot;, &quot;net&quot;: &quot;NET&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;status_map&quot;: { &quot;00&quot;: &quot;paid&quot;, &quot;01&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;, &quot;02&quot;: &quot;failed&quot;, &quot;05&quot;: &quot;refunded&quot;, &quot;09&quot;: &quot;expired&quot; },&#10;  &quot;ref_field&quot;: &quot;MERCHANT_REF&quot;,&#10;  &quot;txn_field&quot;: &quot;CHANNEL_TXN&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_acquirer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"delimiter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"|\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"encoding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"header_rows\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"date_format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yyyyMMddHHmmss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"timezone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Asia/Jakarta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gross\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AMT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FEE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"net\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NET\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status_map\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"paid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"05\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refunded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ref_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MERCHANT_REF\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"txn_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHANNEL_TXN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第三，逐行匹配必须能处理单向记录。</strong> 对账文件是<strong>渠道视角</strong>的，它只包含渠道认为发生了的交易。因此差异有两个方向：我们记为已付、文件里没有（我方多记）；文件里有、我们库里查不到（渠道多记）。两个方向的根因完全不同——前者通常是通知丢失，后者通常是匹配失败（参考号错误）或真的存在幽灵交易。差异必须<strong>分类登记</strong>而不是统一告警，这是<a href=\"../chargeback-local/no-chargeback-methods\">无拒付渠道的退款特点</a>中对账纪律的前置。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，必须能重放。</strong> 因为匹配逻辑会修 bug，所以对账文件的原始内容要按渠道 + 日期存档，解析与匹配逻辑变更后可以<strong>重跑历史</strong>。没有重放能力，一次匹配 bug 就意味着历史差异永远无法自动收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛延迟监控-一个被忽视的核心指标\">收敛延迟监控：一个被忽视的核心指标</h2><p>状态最终会收敛，但「多久收敛」决定了业务能不能用这个渠道。一个没有通知、只靠 T+1 对账的渠道，用户的支付体验是「付完钱页面还在转，第二天才发货」；而一个通知延迟从 2 秒涨到 10 分钟的渠道，从成功率指标上完全看不出来，却已经开始伤害转化。</p>\n<p>因此必须按（渠道 × 来源）分维度记录收敛延迟并埋点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>converged</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>user_completed</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{95}(\\text{latency}) = P_{95}(\\, t_{\\text{converged}} - t_{\\text{user\\_completed}}\\,)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">converged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user_completed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分维度是关键：<code>source=webhook</code> 的 P95 应当在秒级，而 <code>source=recon_file</code> 的 P95 天然是小时级。把两者混在一起统计，得到的数字没有任何诊断价值。这条指标与<a href=\"../testing-launch/local-method-rollout\">按市场灰度与成功率监控</a>中的放量判据直接相连——P95 收敛延迟突然翻倍，是渠道侧开始异常的第一信号，比成功率下降更早出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>通知差异拆成三个正交问题：信息来源、认证完整性、报文语义；其中语义应做成声明式映射，不写代码。</li>\n<li>验签必须用原始字节；验签之后仍须四项核对（单号存在、金额一致、币种一致、渠道单号一致）。</li>\n<li>至少一次 + 无序投递 → 断言表加双唯一键（原文哈希、来源序号），状态推进按渠道业务时间而非到达顺序。</li>\n<li>终态可被更晚的断言推翻：允许恢复，但必须告警，因为这意味着渠道侧异常。</li>\n<li>对账文件渠道是唯一信息源时，解析要声明式、差异要双向分类、原文必须可重放。</li>\n<li>收敛延迟按（渠道 × 来源）分维度监控 P95，它是比成功率更早的故障信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各异步通知与对账协议适配","id":"各异步通知与对账协议适配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个正交的问题","id":"核心概念-三个正交的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"验签：五种方式与两个陷阱","id":"验签-五种方式与两个陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"通知的投递保障与乱序","id":"通知的投递保障与乱序"},{"level":2,"text":"对账文件：既无通知也无查询时的唯一手段","id":"对账文件-既无通知也无查询时的唯一手段"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛延迟监控：一个被忽视的核心指标","id":"收敛延迟监控-一个被忽视的核心指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"支付方式插件化抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/unified-adapter/payment-method-plugin"},"next":{"title":"金额、币种与最小单位差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/local-payment-wallet-bnpl/unified-adapter/local-currency-amount"}}